		-
			message: '''
				#^@covers value \\Drupal\\drupal_kit\\Services\\FrontPageSitemapFilter\:\:filterLink

				A link carrying no path is not a duplicate of anything; it is returned
				untouched rather than guessed at\. references an invalid method\.$#
			'''
			identifier: phpunit.coversMethod
			count: 1
			path: tests/src/Unit/Services/FrontPageSitemapFilterTest.php

		-
			message: '''
				#^@covers value \\Drupal\\drupal_kit\\Services\\FrontPageSitemapFilter\:\:filterLink

				A link simple_sitemap did not attribute to a language — the monolingual
				shape — is judged by any match at all, which is what the pre\-multilingual
				behaviour did and what a single\-language site still needs\. references an invalid method\.$#
			'''
			identifier: phpunit.coversMethod
			count: 1
			path: tests/src/Unit/Services/FrontPageSitemapFilterTest.php

		-
			message: '''
				#^@covers value \\Drupal\\drupal_kit\\Services\\FrontPageSitemapFilter\:\:filterLink

				A surviving link must not re\-advertise the withheld URL through its
				hreflang block — pruning the alternate is the whole point of doing this
				per language rather than per link\. references an invalid method\.$#
			'''
			identifier: phpunit.coversMethod
			count: 1
			path: tests/src/Unit/Services/FrontPageSitemapFilterTest.php

		-
			message: '''
				#^@covers value \\Drupal\\drupal_kit\\Services\\FrontPageSitemapFilter\:\:filterLink

				REGRESSION\. `page\.front` is translatable\. The first version read
				`system\.site` once and applied that one answer to every link, so a site
				pointing each language at its own node lost the node that matched the
				generation\-time language and kept the other language's duplicate\. references an invalid method\.$#
			'''
			identifier: phpunit.coversMethod
			count: 1
			path: tests/src/Unit/Services/FrontPageSitemapFilterTest.php

		-
			message: '''
				#^@covers value \\Drupal\\drupal_kit\\Services\\MenuActiveTrailResolver\:\:buildTrailFromLink

				Unrouted breadcrumb crumbs \(`\!\$url\-\>isRouted\(\)` — e\.g\. external
				URLs surfaced by a custom breadcrumb builder\) are skipped without
				touching the menu link manager; iteration continues to the next
				deeper crumb\. references an invalid method\.$#
			'''
			identifier: phpunit.coversMethod
			count: 1
			path: tests/src/Unit/Services/MenuActiveTrailResolverTest.php

